{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44284","headline":"寄校书七兄 · 李冶","name":"寄校书七兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无事乌程县，蹉跎岁月余。\n不知芸阁吏，寂寞竟何如。\n远水浮仙棹，寒星伴使车。\n因过大雷岸，莫忘八行书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李冶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「寄校书七兄」条，撰者滕伟明、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"滕伟明"}